before your appointment.

171
00:12:37,705 --> 00:12:40,985
I hope you prioritize this aspect as well.

172
00:12:42,185 --> 00:12:43,825
What must come will come.

173
00:12:43,905 --> 00:12:46,745
Instead of waiting passively,
why not make the first move?

174
00:12:51,265 --> 00:12:52,345
Did you send the email?

175
00:12:52,425 --> 00:12:54,665
It was not me. I didn't send it.

176
00:12:55,185 --> 00:12:56,145
Not you?

177
00:12:56,225 --> 00:12:57,945
Are you that naive?

178
00:12:58,545 --> 00:12:59,785
Who do you think Luan Nian is?

179
00:12:59,865 --> 00:13:02,625
Do you think some tasteless scandals
can bring him down?

180
00:13:04,145 --> 00:13:06,025
Mr. Lin will soon be transferred
to the US headquarters.

181
00:13:07,665 --> 00:13:09,985
-Do you know that?
-Do I know that?

182
00:13:11,025 --> 00:13:12,985
Last week, at the executives' meeting,

183
00:13:13,065 --> 00:13:16,065
