his handover plan,

184
00:13:16,145 --> 00:13:17,865
yet you're still asking me if I know that?

185
00:13:17,945 --> 00:13:19,665
I'm asking you about that email
about Luan Nian.

186
00:13:19,745 --> 00:13:22,025
-Are you a fool?
-Are you a fool?

187
00:13:23,305 --> 00:13:24,985
Once Mr. Lin leaves,
who will take over his position?

188
00:13:26,345 --> 00:13:29,865
Why do you think Luan Nian
spent so much effort

189
00:13:29,945 --> 00:13:30,785
