in the end.

194
00:13:39,345 --> 00:13:41,185
How can I compete for Mr. Lin's position?

195
00:13:43,345 --> 00:13:46,265
It's like putting a knife to my throat
by giving him the perfect weapon.

196
00:13:46,345 --> 00:13:49,945
Du Anni, are you mad,
or do you think I no longer want this?

197
00:13:52,385 --> 00:13:54,585
Fine. Don't worry.

198
00:13:55,305 --> 00:13:59,585
If something happens,
I'll make sure you won't be implicated.

199
00:14:12,145 --> 00:14:14,145
-No way.
-Seriously?

200
00:14:15,505 --> 00:14:16,945
That is crazy.

201
00:14:17,025 --> 00:14:18,185
-Yes.
-There are pictures too.

202
00:14:18,265 --> 00:14:19,545
-It can't be fake.
-Flora.

203
00:14:19,625 --> 00:14:20,465
Flora.

204
00:14:21,865 --> 00:14:22,945
Did you receive the email?

205
00:14:23,745 --> 00:14:24,665
You didn't?

206
00:14:25,785 --> 00:14:27,345
Quick. Come here, quickly.

207
00:14:34,985 --> 00:14:36,145
LIME'S SENIOR EXECUTIVE
FOOLS AROUND WITH MULTIPLE WOMEN

208
00:14:36,225 --> 00:14:37,705
I'M ZHANG XIN, EX-GIRLFRIEND OF LUAN NIAN
LIME'S DIRECTOR IN CHINA

209
00:14:42,985 --> 00:14:44,025
I'm going back first.

210
00:15:06,345 --> 00:15:07,785
Lumi.

211
00:15:07,865 --> 00:15:09,305
I've been looking all over for you.

212
00:15:09,385 --> 00:15:10,665
I just came out for some fresh air.

213
00:15:14,385 --> 00:15:15,505
Even you know about it?

214
00:15:18,145 --> 00:15:18,985
Don't believe in it.

215
00:15:19,065 --> 00:15:20,785
This woman used to harass me too.

216
00:15:21,785 --> 00:15:24,385
She called me from overseas
and investigated my background thoroughly.

217
00:15:24,465 --> 00:15:26,425
She even knows
where my parents are staying.

218
00:15:26,505 --> 00:15:28,785
She also harassed other colleagues
and clients.

219
00:15:28,865 --> 00:15:30,105
She's just crazy.

220
00:15:30,185 --> 00:15:31,945
She also sent videos. Seriously.

221
00:15:32,025 --> 00:15:34,305
Is Luke a fool or what?

222
00:15:34,385 --> 00:15:36,425
Why did he date a woman like this?

223
00:15:37,585 --> 00:15:40,305
Do you have the video? Show me.

224
00:15:46,585 --> 00:15:48,945
I know Luan Nian isn't the violent sort.

225
00:15:49,025 --> 00:15:49,865
But…

226
00:15:50,665 --> 00:15:52,425
His name will never be cleared.

227
00:15:58,705 --> 00:15:59,985
Actually, I was there that day.

228
00:16:01,105 --> 00:16:03,305
You were there? Why?

229
00:16:03,385 --> 00:16:07,145
I wanted to buy Luke a meal to thank him,
so I went there.

230
00:16:07,905 --> 00:16:09,825
Tell me what happened that day.

231
00:16:10,585 --> 00:16:11,705
It's a long story.

232
00:16:11,785 --> 00:16:12,865
Don't tell me.

233
00:16:12,945 --> 00:16:14,625
Tell the investigation unit directly.

234
00:16:15,385 --> 00:16:16,665
I'll go with you.

235
00:16:16,745 --> 00:16:18,705
When this woman harassed me,
I had a grudge with her.

236
00:16:18,785 --> 00:16:22,385
So, I kept a record of her spam calls
and emails.

237
00:16:22,465 --> 00:16:24,345
Let's go and become
Luke's witnesses together.

238
00:16:34,905 --> 00:16:36,305
They are from the headquarters.

239
00:16:36,385 --> 00:16:37,665
They are probably here
because of this incident.

240
00:16:38,345 --> 00:16:39,385
Tracy.

241
00:16:40,545 --> 00:16:42,065
Lisa. Take them to the meeting room first.

242
00:16:42,145 --> 00:16:43,785
-All right.
-This way, please.

243
00:16:44,705 --> 00:16:45,905
Why are you two here?

244
00:16:45,985 --> 00:16:47,105
We want to become Luke's witnesses.

245
00:16:47,185 --> 00:16:49,145
-What witness?
-The email.

246
00:16:49,905 --> 00:16:52,105
Regarding this,
Luke specifically mentioned

247
00:16:52,185 --> 00:16:54,025
