to get involved.

248
00:16:54,105 --> 00:16:58,145
Tracy, is this serious?

249
00:16:58,905 --> 00:16:59,745
Don't worry.

250
00:16:59,825 --> 00:17:01,025
The company will deal with it properly.

251
00:17:01,625 --> 00:17:02,865
Go back and wait for updates.

252
00:17:02,945 --> 00:17:03,785
Remember.

253
00:17:03,865 --> 00:17:05,025
Don't ever get yourself involved in this.

254
00:17:06,265 --> 00:17:07,105
I'm going to work.

255
00:17:18,625 --> 00:17:20,665
Perhaps Luke does have a plan.

256
00:17:22,825 --> 00:17:24,585
Let's wait and see.

257
00:17:24,665 --> 00:17:28,625
If we can't attest for him,
we can still think of some other ways.

258
00:17:31,665 --> 00:17:33,865
What kind of person
do you think Luan Nian is?

259
00:17:36,345 --> 00:17:37,385
He's strict.

260
00:17:37,465 --> 00:17:41,625
He's a little heartless,
but he is indeed talented.

261
00:17:41,705 --> 00:17:43,625
Strict. Professional. Serious.

262
00:17:43,705 --> 00:17:45,225
A very good leader.

263
00:17:45,785 --> 00:17:46,625
His flaws…

264
00:17:47,745 --> 00:17:49,145
He gets too much attention from women.

265
00:17:49,225 --> 00:17:53,505
Have you seen him
acting overly intimate with others?

266
00:17:53,585 --> 00:17:56,025
I don't think so.

267
00:17:56,105 --> 00:17:57,105
I'm not sure.

268
00:17:57,705 --> 00:17:58,625
Never.

269
00:17:58,705 --> 00:18:02,385
Do you know anything
about Luan Nian's ex-girlfriend?

270
00:18:03,465 --> 00:18:05,305
How would I know about his private life?

271
00:18:05,385 --> 00:18:06,465
No.

272
00:18:06,545 --> 00:18:08,905
Do you think Luan Nian
has a violent tendency?

273
00:18:08,985 --> 00:18:10,705
-No.
-Of course not.

274
00:18:12,065 --> 00:18:14,065
Do the silent treatment
and being controlling count?

275
00:18:18,345 --> 00:18:19,225
I'm not sure.

276
00:18:29,665 --> 00:18:32,465
Let's skip the pleasantries
and go straight to the point.

277
00:18:33,105 --> 00:18:35,105
Tracy mentioned you would like
to clear something up.

278
00:18:38,505 --> 00:18:39,385
It isn't a clarification per se.

279
00:18:43,705 --> 00:18:45,185
Everyone, you can look at this.

280
00:18:45,265 --> 00:18:47,025
This isn't just an email sent to everyone.

281
00:18:47,105 --> 00:18:47,945
SENDING METHOD: BCC

282
00:18:48,025 --> 00:18:52,425
The sender used the BCC function
and added every receiver manually.

283
00:18:52,505 --> 00:18:53,825
What does this mean?

284
00:18:53,905 --> 00:18:55,825
It means two things. One.

285
00:18:55,905 --> 00:18:58,385
The sender knows the internal
staff organization of Lime clearly.

286
00:18:58,465 --> 00:19:00,385
That is why the person
can choose the recipients precisely.

287
00:19:01,105 --> 00:19:03,865
Two. She deliberately avoided using BCC

288
00:19:03,945 --> 00:19:06,185
and hid the list of all recipients

289
00:19:06,265 --> 00:19:08,505
to prevent me from finding
the source of the leak.

290
00:19:09,865 --> 00:19:14,225
But it is also possible that you leaked
this information to your ex-girlfriend.

291
00:19:16,345 --> 00:19:17,225
You are right.

292
00:19:18,625 --> 00:19:21,185
However, among the recipients
of this email,

293
00:19:21,265 --> 00:19:24,785
there are 11 new employees
who joined less than a year ago.

294
00:19:24,865 --> 00:19:27,385
I broke up with my ex-girlfriend
more than a year ago.

295
00:19:27,465 --> 00:19:30,385
She would never get the email addresses
of these new employees.

296
00:19:45,185 --> 00:19:47,705
Is your dad crazy?

297
00:19:47,785 --> 00:19:50,145
We already opened for business, and now
he wants to take back the property.

298
00:19:50,225 --> 00:19:52,025
My dad doesn't allow me to run a bar.

299
00:19:52,105 --> 00:19:53,185
Why didn't he say this earlier?

300
00:19:53,265 --> 00:19:56,345
If the bar closes down,
all the money we invested will be gone.

301
00:19:56,425 --> 00:19:58,785
My savings don't fall from the sky.

302
00:19:58,865 --> 00:19:59,785
Will your dad compensate me?

303
00:20:00,385 --> 00:20:01,945
Why don't you go talk to my father?

304
00:20:02,025 --> 00:20:03,585
Hey, that's your dad.

305
00:20:03,665 --> 00:20:06,665
I… I can't believe dictatorship
still exists at this time and age.

306
00:20:10,785 --> 00:20:13,145
Luan Nian, isn't your father
and his father best buddies?

307
00:20:13,225 --> 00:20:14,425
Go and talk to him.

308
00:20:15,865 --> 00:20:19,025
Can you two think before you speak?

309
00:20:19,105 --> 00:20:20,905
Asking Luan Nian to talk to his father?

310
00:20:20,985 --> 00:20:22,425
Your bar will close down even sooner.

311
00:20:22,505 --> 00:20:24,025
Exactly. What a terrible idea.

312
00:20:24,105 --> 00:20:26,385
His father and my father
are always on the same page.

313
00:20:26,465 --> 00:20:27,625
Exactly.

314
00:20:27,705 --> 00:20:29,025
Enough. Let's not talk about this.

315
00:20:29,905 --> 00:20:31,785
I'm looking for all of you today
because I need a favor.

316
00:20:31,865 --> 00:20:33,745
-What's wrong?
-You didn't invest a single cent.

317
00:20:33,825 --> 00:20:35,185
Of course, you don't care.

318
00:20:35,265 --> 00:20:37,745
I can cover the equipment
and renovation fees of the bar.

319
00:20:37,825 --> 00:20:40,225
Find a quiet place
to reopen the bar later.

320
00:20:40,305 --> 00:20:42,265
Here's your sponsor daddy.

321
00:20:42,345 --> 00:20:43,545
-Oh my!
-Daddy.

322
00:20:44,145 --> 00:20:46,265
-Get lost.
-You're so generous, Daddy.

323
00:20:47,065 --> 00:20:48,145
Hurry up.

324
00:20:48,865 --> 00:20:50,385
It's your turn to help me out now.

325
00:20:50,465 --> 00:20:52,305
-Go to a place with me later.
-Sure.

326
00:20:52,385 --> 00:20:54,785
-We'll do anything for you.
-No problem.

327
00:21:08,785 --> 00:21:09,705
Over there.

328
00:21:09,785 --> 00:21:11,425
The electrical box is over there.

329
00:21:11,505 --> 00:21:13,185
I thought the circuit breaker
had tripped back then.

330
00:21:13,265 --> 00:21:16,305
After I investigated, the wires
were obviously cut by someone else.

331
00:21:17,025 --> 00:21:19,145
I thought it was done by some naughty kid
from the neighborhood.

332
00:21:19,825 --> 00:21:20,905
When the power went out,

333
00:21:21,545 --> 00:21:23,345
my shop's CCTV stopped recording.

334
00:21:23,425 --> 00:21:25,585
Moreover, I watched the video.

335
00:21:25,665 --> 00:21:29,545
I'm sure she already set up
the camera behind this wall

336
00:21:29,625 --> 00:21:31,105
and edited the captured footage.

337
00:21:31,785 --> 00:21:33,265
Looking at the video's angle,

338
00:21:33,345 --> 00:21:35,665
I'm sure she was recording from there.

339
00:21:35,745 --> 00:21:36,945
Yes.

340
00:21:38,905 --> 00:21:41,145
You two have only been together
for a few days,

341
00:21:41,705 --> 00:21:42,905
and she's already working
with outsiders to set you up.

342
00:21:44,105 --> 00:21:45,625
Do you still not get it?

343
00:21:45,705 --> 00:21:47,145
She was used.

344
00:21:47,225 --> 00:21:50,225
Otherwise, she wouldn't have found
a hidden place like mine.

345
00:21:50,825 --> 00:21:52,785
What is this important deal you're in?

346
00:21:52,865 --> 00:21:56,625
Your enemy had to go out of their way
to film the whole thing.

347
00:21:57,145 --> 00:22:00,745
The only benefit of this job
is that I get to stay away from my father.

348
00:22:01,265 --> 00:22:02,425
We don't have to investigate it.

349
00:22:03,545 --> 00:22:04,385
No.

350
00:22:04,945 --> 00:22:06,665
We must find this jerk.

351
00:22:06,745 --> 00:22:09,105
Even if you're quitting,
you still can't take this lying down.

352
00:22:09,185 --> 00:22:10,425
That's right.

353
00:22:13,785 --> 00:22:17,025
Tan, whose car is this?

354
00:22:17,105 --> 00:22:18,105
What car?

355
00:22:19,025 --> 00:22:20,705
It's for delivering goods
for the shop. Why?

356
00:22:20,785 --> 00:22:22,025
This car has a dashcam.

357
00:22:22,665 --> 00:22:23,985
It has always been recording.

358
00:22:24,505 --> 00:22:26,105
It must have recorded the whole thing.

359
00:22:26,185 --> 00:22:27,905
-You're really lucky.
-Come on. Let's go back to the hotel.

360
00:22:27,985 --> 00:22:29,465
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

361
00:22:47,185 --> 00:22:49,905
LUAN NIAN'S SUSPENSION NOTICE

362
00:22:51,265 --> 00:22:53,505
<i>After internal discussion,</i>
<i>the general manager's office</i>

363
00:22:53,585 --> 00:22:55,185
<i>at headquarters has decided</i>

364
00:22:55,265 --> 00:22:58,145
<i>that all of Luke Luan's duties</i>
<i>will be suspended from today onward</i>

365
00:22:58,225 --> 00:22:59,985
<i>until the investigation result</i>
<i>is released.</i>

366
00:23:00,065 --> 00:23:01,105
<i>During the suspension,</i>

367
00:23:01,185 --> 00:23:04,505
<i>all of Luke Luan's duties</i>
<i>will be temporarily handled by Alex Zhang.</i>

368
00:23:29,905 --> 00:23:31,985
<i>What kind of person</i>
<i>do you think Luan Nian is?</i>

369
00:23:32,585 --> 00:23:34,585
He is a very good leader.

370
00:23:34,665 --> 00:23:37,465
Although he looks aloof and cold
and unapproachable on the outside,

371
00:23:37,545 --> 00:23:40,545
I find him to be patient
after getting to know him.

372
00:23:41,145 --> 00:23:42,545
<i>Moreover, he keeps personal issues</i>
<i>separate from work.</i>

373
00:23:44,305 --> 00:23:45,665
<i>When he is socializing outside,</i>

374
00:23:45,745 --> 00:23:47,945
<i>he'll make sure</i>
<i>his female colleagues feel safe.</i>

375
00:23:48,025 --> 00:23:49,385
<i>He is willing to share his knowledge</i>

376
00:23:49,465 --> 00:23:50,785
<i>even with those</i>
<i>who are not his subordinates.</i>

377
00:23:51,465 --> 00:23:53,905
<i>Many people in the company, including me,</i>

378
00:23:53,985 --> 00:23:55,545
<i>have received his guidance.</i>

379
00:24:07,745 --> 00:24:08,825
Hello.

380
00:24:08,905 --> 00:24:09,905
Visitor needs to register…

381
00:24:11,425 --> 00:24:13,305
Hello. Welcome home.

382
00:24:38,905 --> 00:24:41,305
‎REMOTE, 10:37 PM

383
00:25:40,705 --> 00:25:42,185
It's the middle of the night.

384
00:25:42,265 --> 00:25:43,545
The neighbors will complain

385
00:25:44,065 --> 00:25:45,265
if you keep pressing
the doorbell like crazy.

386
00:25:49,385 --> 00:25:51,625
Don't you know the passcode for my door?

387
00:25:55,065 --> 00:25:55,905
Come in.

388
00:26:06,865 --> 00:26:08,105
You didn't change the passcode?

389
00:26:08,905 --> 00:26:10,105
Why should I?

390
00:26:14,585 --> 00:26:15,505
Are you all right?

391
00:26:16,585 --> 00:26:17,425
Not really.

392
00:26:18,345 --> 00:26:19,225
My face is ruined.

393
00:26:21,065 --> 00:26:22,025
I'm too embarrassed to see anyone.

394
00:26:23,665 --> 00:26:24,585
Did you…

395
00:26:24,665 --> 00:26:26,785
Did you fight with the people
of the investigation unit?

396
00:26:28,785 --> 00:26:30,625
You are really imaginative.

397
00:26:31,425 --> 00:26:32,305
I got nicked by a razor.

398
00:26:33,505 --> 00:26:35,265
All because you keep pressing
the doorbell.

399
00:26:36,385 --> 00:26:37,345
Do you have a band-aid?

400
00:26:37,425 --> 00:26:38,425
Let me put it on for you.

401
00:26:39,665 --> 00:26:41,105
It's in the coffee table's drawer.

402
00:27:17,545 --> 00:27:18,385
Forget it.

403
00:27:19,705 --> 00:27:20,545
It's nothing serious.

404
00:27:25,025 --> 00:27:27,385
Did the investigation unit
talk to you today?

405
00:27:29,665 --> 00:27:33,185
I came here to tell you
that I can be your witness

406
00:27:34,425 --> 00:27:35,585
if you want.

407
00:27:40,865 --> 00:27:43,825
Aren't you trying
to keep a distance from me?

408
00:27:48,385 --> 00:27:50,665
I know you don't want others
to get involved,

409
00:27:51,385 --> 00:27:52,865
but now is not the time for that.

410
00:27:54,745 --> 00:27:55,745
What do you mean?

411
00:27:55,825 --> 00:27:57,865
You've been suspended.

412
00:27:59,745 --> 00:28:00,945
Have you seen those pictures?

413
00:28:04,225 --> 00:28:05,625
You can look at them.

414
00:28:07,505 --> 00:28:08,585
Other people might not see the difference,

415
00:28:09,465 --> 00:28:11,185
but you should know
that the person isn't me.

416
00:28:17,305 --> 00:28:18,225
Come with me.

417
00:28:18,305 --> 00:28:19,265
Let me take you somewhere.

418
00:28:29,665 --> 00:28:30,825
Where is this?

419
00:28:32,865 --> 00:28:34,545
I want to open a bar in the mountains.

420
00:28:36,905 --> 00:28:38,265
What do you think of this place?

421
00:28:40,345 --> 00:28:41,745
Here?

422
00:28:43,865 --> 00:28:44,945
In the mountains.

423
00:28:45,945 --> 00:28:47,625
Something like a private bar.

424
00:28:47,705 --> 00:28:49,385
It'll only be open to a handful of people.

425
00:28:50,025 --> 00:28:51,105
Do you think it'll work?

426
00:28:57,065 --> 00:28:58,225
This place

427
00:29:00,305 --> 00:29:01,945
is good for stargazing.

428
00:29:06,705 --> 00:29:08,865
All right. This is the place, then.

429
00:29:10,225 --> 00:29:11,225
You're making a decision so casually?

430
00:29:11,305 --> 00:29:15,185
Then, I think this place
could use a little makeover.

431
00:29:17,665 --> 00:29:18,665
I'll take your advice.

432
00:29:25,345 --> 00:29:27,225
This place is indeed good for stargazing.

433
00:29:35,145 --> 00:29:37,865
Are you really leaving Lime?

434
00:29:39,465 --> 00:29:42,505
Is this incident that serious?

435
00:29:45,385 --> 00:29:47,025
I don't lose anything if Lime fires me.

436
00:29:47,105 --> 00:29:48,585
Lime will lose a lot, in fact.

437
00:29:51,545 --> 00:29:53,305
You must never leave Lime.

438
00:29:54,145 --> 00:29:55,185
Don't give up.

439
00:29:57,145 --> 00:30:00,385
Because I think you are a great teacher.

440
00:30:00,985 --> 00:30:02,505
I can learn a lot

441
00:30:04,105 --> 00:30:05,665
from you.

442
00:30:08,545 --> 00:30:09,465
Shang Zhitao.

443
00:30:11,265 --> 00:30:12,745
Isn't your desire for knowledge

444
00:30:13,825 --> 00:30:15,185
too strong?

445
00:30:17,385 --> 00:30:18,225
I…

446
00:30:19,065 --> 00:30:22,145
I don't want to lose the opportunity
to learn from you.

447
00:30:22,225 --> 00:30:24,465
Besides, I don't want
to be eliminated from Lime

448
00:30:24,985 --> 00:30:26,025
because of my incompetence.

449
00:30:29,825 --> 00:30:31,985
You might be harsh when you're teaching,

450
00:30:32,065 --> 00:30:33,025
but

451
00:30:33,945 --> 00:30:35,825
everything you've said has been useful.

452
00:30:48,425 --> 00:30:49,945
If I promise you that I won't leave,

453
00:30:51,945 --> 00:30:53,785
can you not keep your distance
from me tonight?

454
00:31:03,545 --> 00:31:04,385
Why are you staring at me?

455
00:31:05,305 --> 00:31:06,945
Am I more interesting than the stars?

456
00:32:40,145 --> 00:32:41,305
<i>The person who falls</i>
<i>for the other person first</i>

457
00:32:41,905 --> 00:32:44,305
<i>will lower all their guard</i>
<i>and lose everything.</i>

458
00:32:47,585 --> 00:32:48,465
<i>I know this.</i>

459
00:32:51,545 --> 00:32:54,905
<i>But I'm just worried</i>
<i>that this wonderful moment</i>

460
00:32:55,665 --> 00:32:57,305
<i>is a result of my recklessness.</i>

461
00:33:09,385 --> 00:33:11,345
It's too late tonight.

462
00:33:11,865 --> 00:33:13,505
I still have to go to work tomorrow.

463
00:33:17,785 --> 00:33:18,905
Let's go back first.

464
00:33:19,705 --> 00:33:20,585
Sure.

465
00:33:45,505 --> 00:33:48,105
Boss. The image verification result,

466
00:33:48,705 --> 00:33:49,985
the footage that shows the truth,

467
00:33:50,065 --> 00:33:51,905
and information about
all related people are inside.

468
00:33:53,105 --> 00:33:55,305
Do you want to submit it
to the investigation unit

469
00:33:55,385 --> 00:33:56,385
or…

470
00:34:03,825 --> 00:34:04,665
Why didn't you

471
00:34:05,545 --> 00:34:07,785
submit this to the investigation
unit yourself?

472
00:34:08,865 --> 00:34:09,744
No need.

473
00:34:12,865 --> 00:34:16,145
But Alex said he didn't do any of these.

474
00:34:16,225 --> 00:34:19,145
Even if he didn't, he is still implicated.

475
00:34:20,145 --> 00:34:22,465
If you still want
to progress further in your career,

476
00:34:23,625 --> 00:34:26,824
making fewer enemies isn't a bad thing.

477
00:34:29,344 --> 00:34:30,505
Yes.

478
00:34:30,585 --> 00:34:32,985
If this breach of confidence
becomes public,

479
00:34:33,065 --> 00:34:36,225
the consequences will be far more dire
than my scandals.

480
00:34:36,304 --> 00:34:38,625
It is no longer an issue
of an employee's character,

481
00:34:38,705 --> 00:34:41,945
but a breach of confidence
caused by internal in-fighting.

482
00:34:42,784 --> 00:34:45,145
When that happens,
the headquarters will punish us,

483
00:34:45,225 --> 00:34:47,425
and all our peers
in the advertising industry

484
00:34:47,505 --> 00:34:48,465
will see us as a laughingstock.

485
00:34:49,505 --> 00:34:51,784
Clients will even switch
to other companies

486
00:34:51,865 --> 00:34:53,225
because of this.

487
00:34:53,304 --> 00:34:54,585
It's just not worth it.

488
00:35:02,825 --> 00:35:04,905
Once this incident is over,

489
00:35:04,985 --> 00:35:07,145
the position of interim general manager
is yours.

490
00:35:08,465 --> 00:35:09,385
It is

491
00:35:11,025 --> 00:35:12,265
supposed to be yours anyway.

492
00:35:13,985 --> 00:35:14,825
Of course.

493
00:35:26,585 --> 00:35:28,745
"Following a thorough investigation
by the joint investigation team,

494
00:35:28,825 --> 00:35:30,305
it is proven that the allegations against

495
00:35:30,385 --> 00:35:32,425
Lime Advertising China's
Creative Director, Luke Luan,

496
00:35:32,505 --> 00:35:35,865
are false and defamatory."

497
00:35:36,385 --> 00:35:39,945
"Relevant details will not be disclosed
to respect the wishes of the parties.

498
00:35:40,025 --> 00:35:42,545
Moving forward,
Lime China's Legal Department

499
00:35:42,625 --> 00:35:45,345
will assist Luan Nian
in taking legal action against Zhang Xin.

500
00:35:45,425 --> 00:35:46,705
Notice is hereby given."

501
00:35:49,025 --> 00:35:50,425
"After a unanimous decision,

502
00:35:50,505 --> 00:35:52,505
Luan Nian will now be appointed

503
00:35:52,585 --> 00:35:55,185
as Lime Advertising China's
Interim General Manager."

504
00:35:57,625 --> 00:35:58,545
APPOINTMENT NOTICE

505
00:36:06,465 --> 00:36:07,385
Hello, Mr. Luan.

506
00:36:24,225 --> 00:36:25,425
Hello, Mr. Luan.

507
00:36:25,505 --> 00:36:26,425
Hello, Mr. Luan.

508
00:36:27,825 --> 00:36:30,945
Inform every division
to have a budget meeting in one hour.

509
00:36:31,025 --> 00:36:32,105
Yes.

510
00:36:33,825 --> 00:36:35,585
The empress has returned.

511
00:36:37,785 --> 00:36:39,985
Excuse me. Please wait
for a while, everyone.

512
00:36:46,985 --> 00:36:48,545
I have so much work to do
as soon as I come back?

513
00:36:49,545 --> 00:36:52,465
These documents require the signature
of a general manager.

514
00:36:52,545 --> 00:36:54,185
Go ahead, Mr. Luan.

515
00:36:55,145 --> 00:36:57,505
I've submitted Flora's promotion to SAE.

516
00:36:57,585 --> 00:36:58,905
Please approve it.

517
00:37:01,545 --> 00:37:03,665
When do you plan to move your office?

518
00:37:03,745 --> 00:37:05,985
Mr. Lin's office has been cleared.

519
00:37:11,625 --> 00:37:12,825
I won't be moving.

520
00:37:12,905 --> 00:37:14,025
This floor is nice.

521
00:37:14,105 --> 00:37:15,425
It's convenient for meetings.

522
00:37:15,505 --> 00:37:17,225
No problem. It's your decision.

523
00:37:18,185 --> 00:37:19,145
You just got appointed.

524
00:37:19,225 --> 00:37:21,905
The most important task
is to restructure our sales team.

525
00:37:21,985 --> 00:37:23,665
They are big shots in the industry.

526
00:37:23,745 --> 00:37:24,905
It's not easy to manage them.

527
00:37:24,985 --> 00:37:25,865
I've been thinking about a reformation.

528
00:37:26,705 --> 00:37:28,425
I'll keep you in the loop
once I come out with the proposal.

529
00:37:29,625 --> 00:37:33,025
Okay. But the elimination rate of the team
should still be kept at 30%.

530
00:37:33,105 --> 00:37:35,905
Otherwise, when the time comes
to evaluate you,

531
00:37:35,985 --> 00:37:36,945
don't blame me
for giving you a bad rating.

532
00:37:39,225 --> 00:37:40,225
Come in.

533
00:37:42,865 --> 00:37:46,385
Luke. Today we need to align the budget
for the project proposal meeting.

534
00:37:46,465 --> 00:37:48,225
I've sent all the details to your email.

535
00:37:48,305 --> 00:37:49,145
Okay.

536
00:37:50,025 --> 00:37:51,265
Who will be present in the meeting?

537
00:37:51,945 --> 00:37:55,105
Since you're newly appointed,
let's visit every division.

538
00:37:55,185 --> 00:37:56,385
Let's go.

539
00:37:58,585 --> 00:37:59,505
Next group.

540
00:38:05,705 --> 00:38:08,585
Let's first talk about the industry
seminar your division is in charge of.

541
00:38:09,945 --> 00:38:12,585
This year, we've decided on cities like
Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, Shenzhen,

542
00:38:12,665 --> 00:38:14,945
Hong Kong, China, Chongqing, and Xiamen.

543
00:38:15,025 --> 00:38:17,425
We also want to invite clients
from various industries

544
00:38:17,505 --> 00:38:18,945
for a joint seminar.

545
00:38:19,025 --> 00:38:20,545
The objective
is client relationship management.

546
00:38:20,625 --> 00:38:24,305
This is also
Lime's most valued annual tradition.

547
00:38:25,665 --> 00:38:27,625
If it's just to maintain
a relationship with clients,

548
00:38:27,705 --> 00:38:29,905
taking them out for a meal and drinks
would be good enough.

549
00:38:30,505 --> 00:38:31,585
A 500,000-yuan budget is good enough.

550
00:38:32,345 --> 00:38:34,105
Why should I spend 17 million yuan

551
00:38:34,185 --> 00:38:36,905
to achieve something
that can be done with 500,000 yuan?

552
00:38:41,585 --> 00:38:42,745
How do you plan to adjust it?

553
00:38:43,745 --> 00:38:45,585
Unless you have a concrete idea,

554
00:38:45,665 --> 00:38:48,145
my suggestion is to remove it completely.

555
00:38:56,545 --> 00:38:58,625
Mr. Luan, what about this?

556
00:38:58,705 --> 00:39:01,905
I'll go back and study more
about this project with my team.

557
00:39:01,985 --> 00:39:05,865
Actually, managing client relationships
is just a small part of this project.

558
00:39:05,945 --> 00:39:09,185
Making an impact in the industry
is also very important.

559
00:39:10,185 --> 00:39:11,785
Besides the list of clients,

560
00:39:11,865 --> 00:39:12,905
what kind of experts can you invite,

561
00:39:12,985 --> 00:39:14,385
and how many potential clients
can you bring?

562
00:39:16,425 --> 00:39:18,145
Study it carefully
before we decide if we want it.

563
00:39:22,545 --> 00:39:24,225
Alex, is that okay with you?

564
00:39:28,025 --> 00:39:29,065
Of course.

565
00:39:32,665 --> 00:39:33,705
What about you, Annie?

566
00:39:35,905 --> 00:39:37,745
Whatever you say.

567
00:39:39,345 --> 00:39:40,185
All right.

568
00:39:40,785 --> 00:39:43,385
I'll have to trouble all of you
to revise everything.

569
00:39:43,465 --> 00:39:45,825
Every budget
will be discussed again tomorrow.

570
00:39:45,905 --> 00:39:47,465
My request is simple.

571
00:39:47,545 --> 00:39:51,145
Think it through
before you decide on doing something.

572
00:39:51,225 --> 00:39:53,385
Once everyone agrees on the core progress,

573
00:39:53,465 --> 00:39:54,705
make sure to report back.

574
00:39:55,865 --> 00:39:59,025
There must be a solution
to every problem you encounter.

575
00:39:59,105 --> 00:40:00,425
Okay?

576
00:40:03,185 --> 00:40:05,305
Mr. Luan is asking
if all of you are okay with it.

577
00:40:07,585 --> 00:40:09,905
-Who is doing the meeting minutes?
-I am.

578
00:40:09,985 --> 00:40:11,585
After the meeting,

579
00:40:11,665 --> 00:40:13,505
send it to everyone
who is in this meeting and CC me.

580
00:40:13,585 --> 00:40:14,425
Okay.

581
00:40:18,705 --> 00:40:20,985
He sure makes full use
of his first day of work.

582
00:40:21,065 --> 00:40:23,425
Be careful. Mind your attitude.

583
00:40:23,505 --> 00:40:25,305
We are talking about more than
10 million yuan. How should I react?

584
00:40:26,305 --> 00:40:27,865
Everyone, gather around.

585
00:40:33,265 --> 00:40:34,505
I have an announcement to make.

586
00:40:34,585 --> 00:40:37,065
There'll be a friendly
basketball match with Yueteng.

587
00:40:37,145 --> 00:40:39,585
It won't be considered as your KPI
or your job.

588
00:40:39,665 --> 00:40:40,705
Which division can handle it?

589
00:40:40,785 --> 00:40:42,465
Who wants to take charge?

590
00:40:49,345 --> 00:40:50,705
I can do it.

591
00:40:55,185 --> 00:40:56,385
Okay.

592
00:40:56,465 --> 00:40:58,465
I'll leave it to you. Thank you.

593
00:41:23,865 --> 00:41:24,705
Feeling vindicated?

594
00:41:26,185 --> 00:41:27,025
Do you feel vindicated?

595
00:41:28,505 --> 00:41:29,465
Yes.

596
00:41:30,225 --> 00:41:32,985
Actually, I received
Luke's email last night.

597
00:41:33,705 --> 00:41:36,265
He told me he would initiate
the project budget meeting

598
00:41:36,345 --> 00:41:37,665
and the project evaluation today.

599
00:41:37,745 --> 00:41:39,385
I got it immediately.

600
00:41:40,025 --> 00:41:42,385
I was sure that he solved everything.

601
00:41:43,385 --> 00:41:44,505
But this morning,

602
00:41:45,105 --> 00:41:48,705
I still felt excited
when I received this email.

603
00:41:48,785 --> 00:41:49,825
It felt so good.

604
00:41:52,425 --> 00:41:54,825
Lumi, what project evaluation?

605
00:41:54,905 --> 00:41:56,905
Can I join?

606
00:41:56,985 --> 00:41:59,585
Because I want to become
an independent project manager.

607
00:41:59,665 --> 00:42:01,145
Doing this helps gather experience.

608
00:42:01,225 --> 00:42:02,865
No, Shang Zhitao.

609
00:42:02,945 --> 00:42:05,225
Are you even normal?

610
00:42:05,305 --> 00:42:07,465
Why do you like to work so much?

611
00:42:09,345 --> 00:42:12,225
If you want to do it,
go and ask the boss directly.

612
00:42:12,825 --> 00:42:15,385
He is now the general manager.

613
00:42:15,465 --> 00:42:16,865
General manager.

614
00:42:17,945 --> 00:42:18,905
Go for it.

615
00:42:21,425 --> 00:42:22,505
Lumi.

616
00:42:23,745 --> 00:42:27,145
You are so capable,
and you can do everything well.

617
00:42:27,225 --> 00:42:31,345
Why don't you request
to handle a project all by yourself?

618
00:42:32,185 --> 00:42:33,865
Handling a project all by myself?

619
00:42:33,945 --> 00:42:36,585
Forget it. I'm already tired enough.

620
00:42:37,865 --> 00:42:41,145
I'm working because I just
want something to do.

621
00:42:42,105 --> 00:42:43,465
I have Luke to cover me.

622
00:42:43,545 --> 00:42:46,225
I'm grateful to the competitive Luke

623
00:42:46,305 --> 00:42:48,225
for letting me achieve great things
by doing nothing.

624
00:42:52,305 --> 00:42:53,825
He is quite a hard worker.

625
00:42:53,905 --> 00:42:55,305
If he doesn't work hard,

626
00:42:55,385 --> 00:43:00,385
how can he manage such a big team
in the advertising industry?

627
00:43:03,345 --> 00:43:07,185
Everything is good about him,

628
00:43:07,785 --> 00:43:10,345
but you must never fall for him.

629
00:43:11,785 --> 00:43:13,545
Why not?

630
00:43:14,145 --> 00:43:16,785
He has a really bad temper.

631
00:43:18,065 --> 00:43:20,945
Even someone as experienced as me

632
00:43:21,025 --> 00:43:23,425
will probably be brokenhearted
and shed tears because of him.

633
00:43:25,225 --> 00:43:28,785
However, I don't mind being friends

634
00:43:29,465 --> 00:43:31,345
with someone as handsome as him.

635
00:43:33,025 --> 00:43:34,865
Tracy, you're right.

636
00:43:34,945 --> 00:43:36,905
You run your mouth like a train.

637
00:43:37,985 --> 00:43:39,625
I'm the high-speed rail.

